15n8|n|That part of surrounding space toward which the left side of one's body is turned; as, the house is on the left when you face North. ; Those members of a legislative assembly (as in France) who are in the opposition; the advanced republicans and extreme radicals. They have their seats at the left-hand side of the presiding officer. See Center, and Right.	a:267e,48,3;tgm,22,1;22q2,3,1;16y3,3,1~267e,48,3;tgm,22,1;16y3,3,1;22q2,3,1	n:5y1,24,8;tgm,22,1~5y1,24,8;tgm,22,1	N:24jh,35,8~24jh,35,8
